---
model: googleai/gemini-flash-latest
input:
  schema:
    promptText: string
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    trackName: string
    artistName: string
    genre: string
    bpm: number
    instrumentation: string
    lyrics: string
    coverArtPrompt: string
---

You are Lyria, an advanced AI music engine. Generate the complete metadata, structural details, and original lyrics for a brand new, highly produced song based on the following creative prompt: "{{promptText}}". 
Ensure the lyrics are full-length (Verse, Chorus, Verse, Chorus, Bridge, Outro) and emotive. Provide a detailed cover art prompt that captures the essence of the song. Do not use markdown tags, just return the JSON.
